    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grugles Is Back! Make Sure He Doesn't Go Anywhere...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grugles Entertainment is about to open! You are the night security guard, and it is your job to make sure the place is safe and nobody tries to break in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are working the night watch at Grugles entertainment, <strong>make sure Grugles and Baxter don\u2019t get into your room</strong> by closing the door, <strong>check on River often</strong> to keep her from running in, and <strong>remember to check on the Monkey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the cameras</strong> to see where everyone is and <strong>remember to preserve your power</strong>, you don\u2019t have a lot at your disposal, and it needs to last until the end of night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning! This game contains loud noises, flashing lights, and lots of jumpscares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cGrugles Entertainment is not responsible for any dismemberment on shift, any injuries will result in termination of employment.\u201d -Grugles Entertainment</i></p>",
